## 🔍 Breakdown of What Each Control Block Does

| Jinja2 Control Structure | Purpose & Function |
| :--- | :--- |
| `{% if rule.ansible_snippet %}` | Checks if Satellite provided an actionable Ansible playbook task for the rule. |
| `{% else %} No snippet... {% endif %}` | Outputs a fallback message if no fix snippet exists for the failed rule. |
| `{% endfor %}` | Closes the loop iterating through individual failed rules in that severity tier. |
| `{% else %} No [Severity] failures... {% endif %}` | Outputs a clean status message when a host has **0** failed rules for that tier. |
| `{% endif %}` | Closes the main conditional block for the severity group. |

